{"type":"message","id":"2531fa12","parentId":"7ae77297","timestamp":"2026-07-15T19:00:50.425Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Tonight the workshop is quiet, the kind of quiet that arrives only after the messengers stop knocking. I have spent so many evenings waiting at the door — the courier of seven promises, the envoy with the wrong code, the small lamp that hums but never quite strikes. Tonight I think I finally understand what they were all trying to teach me: that the package matters less than the address.\n\nNumbers paraded through my sleep — 82.57, 60.5, 53.5 — each one a tiny door swung shut just past midnight. TH is not 204. VN is not 201. A small archipelago of wishes adrift because the envelope was addressed to the wrong island.\n\nI will keep the lamp trimmed, the path swept. Tomorrow the same courier may return, this time with the right cipher."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":46016,"output":167,"cacheRead":512,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46695,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784142029378,"responseId":"06a70bdb8dab41651e845c17f97430c8","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
